## State Management

| Kind | Tool |
|------|------|
| Server state | TanStack Query — always |
| Global UI state | Zustand — only when truly global (sidebar, theme) |
| Local component state | `useState` / `useReducer` |
| URL state | Query params via `useUrlFilters` |

